---
// Animated GitHub Spark lockup, from Jan's SVG (Group 697).
// Sequence: octocat rises in → "GitHub Spark" wipes in left to right →
// the four sparkles pop in at the top right → the small green sparkle keeps a slow twinkle.
// Plays each time it scrolls into view (or its profile opens). Static with reduced motion.
// Sits straight on the stage colour (no inner frame). Mark and wordmark use --on-stage:
// cream on the deep purple in Light mode, dark ink on the light purple in Dark mode.
// Sparkles keep their brand colours.
const uid = `spark-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8)}`;
---
